  "content": "<p data-pid=\"1oDF8uyo\">越扭曲越好是吧？扭曲爱好者来发言一下（bushi</p><p data-pid=\"myT0DhSz\">敲完下面的作品我嘴角已经扭成麻花了。</p><p data-pid=\"mJe06hGq\">警告：如果在阅读以下内容时感到不适，请立即退出此页面。</p><h2>污秽不堪的你最可爱了（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"dUOvl7sb\">BE 警告。呕吐警告。疼痛警告。有些画面我看得都疼。</p><p data-pid=\"71-H8G-w\">以下是京都大学百合研究会的整活：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1109\" data-rawheight=\"1479\" data-original-token=\"v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1109\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1109&#39; height=&#39;1479&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1109\" data-rawheight=\"1479\" data-original-token=\"v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1109\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-92c11c2f07e2ffd0c4bb295a215e61e9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>毁掉一切地狱再爱（连载中）</h2><p data-pid=\"UsMfY5dy\">害，原生家庭。毁灭吧（</p><p data-pid=\"SzBIzcaX\">还有贵圈真乱，坏女人转学，青梅黑化等胃疼要素。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-69ade67907755b64253a4efd3c375d39_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1788\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-original-token=\"v2-69ade67907755b64253a4efd3c375d39\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1788\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-69ade67907755b64253a4efd3c375d39_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1788&#39; height=&#39;2048&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1788\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-original-token=\"v2-69ade67907755b64253a4efd3c375d39\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1788\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-69ade67907755b64253a4efd3c375d39_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-69ade67907755b64253a4efd3c375d39_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>因为今天女友不在（连载中）</h2><p data-pid=\"E7pA1wHj\">引诱入间人间走上歧途（？）的作品。</p><p data-pid=\"-g3QZmTf\">最近几话又加人物了，胃疼要素 up up</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-9db62f268a4a5359152282e12ab3a473_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1450\" data-original-token=\"v2-9db62f268a4a5359152282e12ab3a473\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-9db62f268a4a5359152282e12ab3a473_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2048&#39; height=&#39;1450&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1450\" data-original-token=\"v2-9db62f268a4a5359152282e12ab3a473\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-9db62f268a4a5359152282e12ab3a473_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-9db62f268a4a5359152282e12ab3a473_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>我的百合乃工作是也（连载中）</h2><p data-pid=\"vXDQK27w\">单箭头太多啦！</p><p data-pid=\"18lLtFTO\">还有什么我会继续喜欢 A，但 B 你不要抑制自己，继续喜欢我（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7ec11ba05787c0c9106b03fcab8ecdda_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1448\" data-original-token=\"v2-7ec11ba05787c0c9106b03fcab8ecdda\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7ec11ba05787c0c9106b03fcab8ecdda_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2048&#39; height=&#39;1448&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1448\" data-original-token=\"v2-7ec11ba05787c0c9106b03fcab8ecdda\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7ec11ba05787c0c9106b03fcab8ecdda_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7ec11ba05787c0c9106b03fcab8ecdda_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>无法向星星许愿的恋情（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"peaY7D9w\">如果第一话你没被雷到的话，后面应该也不会被雷到了，反正扭曲要素拉满。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ff2a2fcdd80df145ddfc201142fe6c50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1736\" data-rawheight=\"1953\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff2a2fcdd80df145ddfc201142fe6c50\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1736\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ff2a2fcdd80df145ddfc201142fe6c50_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1736&#39; height=&#39;1953&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1736\" data-rawheight=\"1953\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff2a2fcdd80df145ddfc201142fe6c50\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1736\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-ff2a2fcdd80df145ddfc201142fe6c50_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ff2a2fcdd80df145ddfc201142fe6c50_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>对我垂涎欲滴的非人少女（连载中）</h2><p data-pid=\"Vnsx3ci0\">女主死感真的有点重了（</p><p data-pid=\"6KzKfGxh\">你们三个把日子过好比什么都重要</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-13a8ac4974a3534afb22df4188689527_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1467\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-original-token=\"v2-13a8ac4974a3534afb22df4188689527\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1467\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-13a8ac4974a3534afb22df4188689527_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1467&#39; height=&#39;2048&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1467\" data-rawheight=\"2048\" data-original-token=\"v2-13a8ac4974a3534afb22df4188689527\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1467\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-13a8ac4974a3534afb22df4188689527_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-13a8ac4974a3534afb22df4188689527_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>Happy Sugar Life（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"uwhzjyvw\">杀人藏尸、纵火、绑架、共同赴死（</p><p data-pid=\"0Qt2QdV-\">反正要素拉满。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-991ebd794c6dced5bed938e791be47ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1200\" data-rawheight=\"1582\" data-original-token=\"v2-991ebd794c6dced5bed938e791be47ba\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1200\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-991ebd794c6dced5bed938e791be47ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1200&#39; height=&#39;1582&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1200\" data-rawheight=\"1582\" data-original-token=\"v2-991ebd794c6dced5bed938e791be47ba\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1200\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-991ebd794c6dced5bed938e791be47ba_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-991ebd794c6dced5bed938e791be47ba_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>班上的公主是我的小狗（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"4MgmFIc5\">谁是公主谁是小狗我不好说，还有下克上，笑</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-65b430e0ad8b088f81003dc01bf14f93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2008\" data-rawheight=\"1149\" data-original-token=\"v2-65b430e0ad8b088f81003dc01bf14f93\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2008\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-65b430e0ad8b088f81003dc01bf14f93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2008&#39; height=&#39;1149&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2008\" data-rawheight=\"1149\" data-original-token=\"v2-65b430e0ad8b088f81003dc01bf14f93\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2008\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-65b430e0ad8b088f81003dc01bf14f93_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-65b430e0ad8b088f81003dc01bf14f93_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>与她女友的不纯初恋（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"Dgt-lKsl\">Akeo 老师又来写梯形关系美学了（指拆两对凑一对（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-08b7231ee6733c8bd7ae80ce32a08baf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1000\" data-rawheight=\"709\" data-original-token=\"v2-08b7231ee6733c8bd7ae80ce32a08baf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1000\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-08b7231ee6733c8bd7ae80ce32a08baf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1000&#39; height=&#39;709&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1000\" data-rawheight=\"709\" data-original-token=\"v2-08b7231ee6733c8bd7ae80ce32a08baf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1000\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-08b7231ee6733c8bd7ae80ce32a08baf_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-08b7231ee6733c8bd7ae80ce32a08baf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>我心爱之人的妹妹（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"aRvBADj0\">三角、姐妹、代餐、白学……甚至还有牛啊！</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-669c4d05a310dc34e1c658887d836c6d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"852\" data-rawheight=\"782\" data-original-token=\"v2-669c4d05a310dc34e1c658887d836c6d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"852\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-669c4d05a310dc34e1c658887d836c6d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;852&#39; height=&#39;782&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"852\" data-rawheight=\"782\" data-original-token=\"v2-669c4d05a310dc34e1c658887d836c6d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"852\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-669c4d05a310dc34e1c658887d836c6d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-669c4d05a310dc34e1c658887d836c6d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2><span class=\"nolink\">我的初恋对象与人接吻了</span>（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"QqhhFdfx\">入间人间在《安达与岛村》后的下一部作品，从此揭开地平家的黑暗（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-dd584c8637480d86a05cff271ec64b74_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1500\" data-rawheight=\"1064\" data-original-token=\"v2-dd584c8637480d86a05cff271ec64b74\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1500\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dd584c8637480d86a05cff271ec64b74_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1500&#39; height=&#39;1064&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1500\" data-rawheight=\"1064\" data-original-token=\"v2-dd584c8637480d86a05cff271ec64b74\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1500\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dd584c8637480d86a05cff271ec64b74_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-dd584c8637480d86a05cff271ec64b74_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2><span class=\"nolink\">人妻教师被班里的女高中生迷得神魂颠倒的故事</span>（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"se64vaMk\">抱歉我真的无法用言语描述入间人间在创作什么伟大作品（</p><p data-pid=\"ikXxJdrF\">最后真坐牢了。入间人间没坐过牢，所以没写具体怎么坐牢，希望他去蹲一下局子采风一下（bushi</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d729b1dda6026ffaba6d871c420b10c8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1740\" data-rawheight=\"1244\" data-original-token=\"v2-d729b1dda6026ffaba6d871c420b10c8\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1740\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d729b1dda6026ffaba6d871c420b10c8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1740&#39; height=&#39;1244&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1740\" data-rawheight=\"1244\" data-original-token=\"v2-d729b1dda6026ffaba6d871c420b10c8\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1740\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d729b1dda6026ffaba6d871c420b10c8_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d729b1dda6026ffaba6d871c420b10c8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>円満家庭の人妻が娘の友達にドはまりする話（连载中）</h2><p data-pid=\"pm5etgLV\">看完这个标题后评价就是逆天。跟地平家扯上关系肯定没好事（</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ff33d4ab6922068b586a5a15e2279156_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"705\" data-rawheight=\"1000\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff33d4ab6922068b586a5a15e2279156\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"705\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ff33d4ab6922068b586a5a15e2279156_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;705&#39; height=&#39;1000&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"705\" data-rawheight=\"1000\" data-original-token=\"v2-ff33d4ab6922068b586a5a15e2279156\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"705\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ff33d4ab6922068b586a5a15e2279156_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ff33d4ab6922068b586a5a15e2279156_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><h2>你永远地扭曲了我/君が永久に歪ませた（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"txOdRR96\">六人扭曲大戏，还有病娇。可惜是 カクヨム 上的百合网文，没有文库化，所以没有插画。</p><h2>献给月与海豚的歌（已完结）</h2><p data-pid=\"fhnPF5gM\">BE，人妻，婚外情，盲人，代餐文学。这也太胃疼了。同上，为百合网文。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"UWW_8PPS\">感觉得劲的还得是看百合漫画或者小说。动画大部分都不够扭（也可能是我阅片量不够），以下是 AI 根据我的<a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/60331\" class=\"internal\" target=\"_blank\">百合作品分类档案</a>推荐的动画作品：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"SeigYgPL\">百合熊风暴：捕食、食人、身体恐怖、自杀愿望、威胁身体自主、情感操纵与依赖</li><li data-pid=\"WgOIIKDs\">女恶魔人：吃人／捕食、排斥与霸凌、独占、嫉妒、背叛、死亡、记忆抹除、身体变形</li><li data-pid=\"YboWeQ15\">选择扩散者WIXOSS：操纵、虐待、依赖、身体置换、自残</li></ul>",
